<title>MEXICO: Accelsa 6-mo net profit falls.</title>
<headline>Accelsa 6-mo net profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>6-mos 1997		   6-mos 1996</p>
<p>	Shr		 n.a.		     n.a.</p>
<p>	Net		 44.76 million		81.49 million</p>
<p>	Oper		108.95 million	     95.94 million</p>
<p>	Revs		1.192 bln		1.111 bln</p>
<p>	Integ fin cost  4.96 million	  gain 8.22 million</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in Mexican pesos.</p>
<p>Full company name is Accel SA.</p>
